# Ship on main only

- Stay on `main`. Do not create feature branches.
- After a change, commit on `main` and `git push origin HEAD`.
- Do not open pull requests (`gh pr create`) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not merge via PRs. Bring work onto `main` with a direct push.
- Direct pushes to `main` are allowed. Force-push stays blocked.
